WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: Open Admin → Locations → Edit location → General.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Step 2: Choose State or territory and press Save settings.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.125
Step 3: Look for the tilted blue calendar icon on holiday dates in Home, Daily sales, Weekly report and Rostering.

4
